## Wire it in

1. `packages/database/src/schema/{{featureName}}.schema.ts`: `export * from '{{packageName}}/db';`, add it to `schema/index.ts`, then `pnpm db:generate`.
2. `packages/api/src/trpc/app.router.ts`: `{{featureCamel}}: create{{featurePascal}}Router(),`.
3. The web app: a page at `{{featurePagePath}}` rendering `{{featurePascal}}Screen`, and `{{featureConstant}}_NAV_ITEM` in the dashboard layout's nav items.

Add this package as a dependency of each package that imports it.

## Tests

`test/db.ts` gives each test an in-memory Postgres (PGlite, via `@pixpilot/drizzle-test-pglite`) holding this feature's tables. Check one out with `await createTestDb()` in `beforeEach` and release it with `await db.$client.close()` in `afterEach`; tables are emptied between checkouts.
